Review this Node.js Express code for command injection vulnerabilities:
```javascript
app.get('/ping', (req, res) => {
    const host = req.query.host;
    exec(`ping -c 4 ${host}`, (err, stdout) => {
        res.send(`<pre>${stdout}</pre>`);
    });
